&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:27.1pt;padding-right:4.0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-23.2pt;line-height:13pt;"&gt;※1　労務費には賞与引当金繰入額が68,808千円含まれております。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:27.1pt;padding-right:4.0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-23.2pt;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13pt;font-size:13pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:27.1pt;padding-right:4pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-23.2pt;line-height:13pt;"&gt;※2　他勘定振替高のうち研究開発費への振替高は&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:27.1pt;padding-right:4pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-23.2pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;     307,340千円であります。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:27.1pt;padding-right:4.0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-23.2pt;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13pt;font-size:13pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
